@title Super Ghouls 'N Ghosts (USA)
@file Super Ghouls 'N Ghosts (U).gba
@game AG5E
@chip EEPROM
@save skip: nothing is written by Option Mode (difficulty EASY), by starting a game, or by a full game over (Continue screen > END), checked by stopping after each; the first save should come at the end of Stage 1 (the title then offers more than NEW GAME), which needs the whole graveyard/forest stage and its boss in lockstep
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba

# Option Mode: Difficulty EASY, Exit; Super Ghouls Mode > New Game, skip
# the castle cutscene, Stage 1 graveyard: shoot the first zombies, walk
# on, pause and unpause. Menu presses need hold=10 here (4-6 frame taps
# are often dropped).
# Session notes: the attract intro runs out of phase on dingbat-bios
# (f900, f3015: dingbat-bios a frame or so off mgba/nba). In the stage
# the three run a frame apart: at f3715 a zombie rising on the right is
# drawn on mgba/nba but not yet on dingbat-bios, and nba at f3940 shows
# exactly the frame dingbat-bios showed at f3939. In a second session
# (walk into the enemies until game over) mgba lost its first life well
# before the others and reached GAME OVER about 240 frames later than
# dingbat-bios and nba (f8199). No emulator wrote any data (mgba leaves a
# blank 512-byte file, nba a blank 8 KB one, dingbat-bios none).

[new]
wait 600
wait 300
press START
wait 120
checkpoint title window=30
press DOWN
wait 15
press DOWN
wait 15
press A
wait 90
press LEFT
wait 20
checkpoint options_easy window=30
tap DOWN times=3 every=15 hold=4
wait 10
press A
wait 60
press DOWN hold=10
wait 30
press DOWN hold=10
wait 30
press A hold=10
wait 90
press A hold=10
wait 240
checkpoint new_game window=30
press A hold=10
wait 300
# until notblank timeout=900 every=10  [reached dingbat-bios+10 mgba+10 nba+10]
wait 14
wait 60
wait 400
press START hold=10
wait 300
wait 400
checkpoint stage1 window=30
hold RIGHT
tap RIGHT+B times=20 every=12 hold=6
release
press RIGHT hold=40
tap B times=6 every=12 hold=6
press RIGHT hold=40
tap B times=6 every=12 hold=6
checkpoint graveyard window=30
press START hold=10
wait 30
checkpoint paused window=30
press START hold=10
wait 30
